{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_02_030_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:e97d056cc7952437113adc37960f8ead824e9bd410b164cb032ac35e119fae7f",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_02_030_22:5_02_030_22_a:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0af669632c3c38cd06f81dfed8954cc1be7575f9af6103f8af9ad9aabe51cb7c",
      "text": "啊，找到你了，\n●●●●プロデューサー！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_030_22:5_02_030_22_a:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5aa7c26963e6296d0dab5f96cc0fada05fd61f5499f0cd75164cc6edb5f22d8a",
      "text": "这个，不嫌弃的话请收下吧！\n是情人节巧克力的回礼哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_030_22:5_02_030_22_a:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9cca114241dcc1eeb7a5da75282a032b05da04d0af4adc791cc47c424fc11479",
      "text": "因为制作人特意考虑着我的喜好挑选了巧克力，\n我真的超级开心的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_030_22:5_02_030_22_a:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d7de3cfbb8b728f04b8e60de4931af3c15c9e130e047b5b17e3ee1c7ed2fc2ad",
      "text": "所以我也挑选了感觉●●●●プロデューサー会喜欢的\n东西试着送给你！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_030_22:5_02_030_22_a:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e381d271dc685cca3d0821812650e2d2ca39df965fa49da06201293495b3105",
      "text": "我送的礼物，\n要是能合你心意的话我就很高兴了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_030_22:5_02_030_22_b:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fbb31d5868b6b30158a2e1978acb6b2275b27303c742ce924f27ead39b4bf78c",
      "text": "啊，●●●●プロデューサー！\n百忙之中占用你的时间真不好意思。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_030_22:5_02_030_22_b:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e06e64dec1661791dc7a7ec364eba737e425ea27386501af8f3e33f529a2ec2d",
      "text": "其实我是想把情人节的\n回礼交给你呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_030_22:5_02_030_22_b:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5f71a162cfbe64129f7bcf094d059823177f82f4f729353be15397e4db614b44",
      "text": "给，这个不嫌弃的话请收下吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_030_22:5_02_030_22_b:cmd-000027:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c3d1193854168bf2945a493823a88bbf397877368fa9c2ec0e63715c4f152cd",
      "text": "非常感谢。我真的很高兴",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_030_22:5_02_030_22_b:cmd-000028:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fdb66c8300e5b90e8078ac36b53226814c56be562da3f0d61069156d13199f66",
      "text": "真的可以收下吗？非常感谢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_030_22:5_02_030_22_b:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1660acd954271f960743bc4d44256415377557169cc26a3c41a246c0ebaa47fa",
      "text": "呵呵，能看到●●●●プロデューサー开心的\n表情，我也好高兴啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_030_22:5_02_030_22_b:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1660acd954271f960743bc4d44256415377557169cc26a3c41a246c0ebaa47fa",
      "text": "呵呵，能看到●●●●プロデューサー开心的\n表情，我也好高兴啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_030_22:5_02_030_22_b:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e38abc5c2b972929211ffc8753e912ca4ec6fbbfaca8cdd43b535e8f9c52e1e0",
      "text": "虽然在送什么好上面烦恼了很久，\n还特意去店里踩点调研过……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_030_22:5_02_030_22_b:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ed68dc1fef5bae20947b4d887937a0d6bf5b1c46fff8158a7838a397cd8b76b5",
      "text": "但我总觉得这份礼物肯定是最能让你感到开心的了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_030_22:5_02_030_22_b:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea8b607b9de82a460b3ac1a37ac7be42a3e07bce61d9481a3b3b73f3ae6ec1c9",
      "text": "我可是相当有自信的哦。\n工作结束之后看看吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_030_22:5_02_030_22_b:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70b9ea29e133b125771db6688ada349a8d0c29fcb0cbb0481e26134521788632",
      "text": "话说回来，从●●●●プロデューサー那里收到的\n巧克力，真的好好吃啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_030_22:5_02_030_22_b:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2905e0ac2c024cb1c01ade35ed358cb14a52230b91c01efbf02ca70107e84644",
      "text": "明年的情人节我也可以期待一下吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
